<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Confuciusornis sanctus Turing wavelength at 143.4 µm (Yixian Fm, 125.0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Equations 1–5 are the Schnakenberg system, its Jacobian, and Turing's k_c formula. Self-test checks trace < 0, det > 0, the instability margin, λ_c = 143.4 µm, a positive critical growth rate, and a stable equal-diffusion spectrum. Six Lean theorems encode the same integer inequality with zero sorry. Deduction: the kinetics are a reconstructed carrier, not Prum & Williamson or Harris et al. parameter values." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2026-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0.py L53–L61: a, b, Du, Dv are slot calibrations, not a published feather table <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc/models/2026-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L53-L61>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Confuciusornis sanctus Turing wavelength at 143.4 µm (Yixian Fm, 125.0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 44/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The saturated field's dominant Fourier mode is 8, matching N = L/λ_c, and σ(k_c) = 0.0425. The wavelength value equals its calibration reference, so it is not an independent specimen measurement. Pearson r, RMSE, and a KS comparison are absent, and the photograph is not segmented." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-critical-mode-growth-rate>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-critical-turing-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dominant-fourier-mode-on-the-8-wavelength-collar>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-analytic-growth-rate-ceiling>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-yixian-geological-age>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 4.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Confuciusornis sanctus Turing wavelength at 143.4 µm (Yixian Fm, 125.0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 63.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 implements Schnakenberg kinetics whose analytic critical wavelength is 143.4 µm (log10 size -3.843) at the Yixian 125.0 Ma horizon. The periodic collar of 1147.2 µm selects Fourier mode 8. The equal-diffusion control is analytic only (σ_max < 0). The comparison figure shows the CC BY-SA 4.0 Senckenberg slab beside the stripe field; the GIF is the unfitted stripe field (12 frames, 640×480). No diffusion-ratio sweep, spatial ablation, specimen CV segmentation, or Pearson/RMSE/KS fit yet. Overall 63.3/100 (faithfulness 55.4, reproducibility 81.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 82, Morphological realism / specimen match 48, Parameter expressivity 38, Morphometric validation 44, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 76, Reproducibility package 80. Output judged: docs/media/confuciusornis_sanctus_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 472183 B, 1512×552 px, artifact_sha256 efc52c8d4fd1f391fd2c11c84b3dbb4c2dc0cc6333ba2bb360b8750fbaddb4e9 (sha256 efc52c8d4fd1f391fd2c11c84b3dbb4c2dc0cc6333ba2bb360b8750fbaddb4e9), spec_fingerprint eefa4e9a500552e28e1fe0176dd6aca52038d5438def2a8270217cfbd375bf34. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: eefa4e9a500552e28e1fe0176dd6aca52038d5438def2a8270217cfbd375bf34; artifact_sha256: efc52c8d4fd1f391fd2c11c84b3dbb4c2dc0cc6333ba2bb360b8750fbaddb4e9; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/confuciusornis_sanctus_turing_wavelength_s0/confuciusornis_sanctus_specimen.jpg=9e83715a2090a049..., datasets/confuciusornis_sanctus_turing_wavelength_s0/confuciusornis_sanctus_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=95376a32ced97ca5..., datasets/confuciusornis_sanctus_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=969b2a6a15f61ba8...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) critical wavenumber from the dispersion relation | Within-feather pigment bars and spots are a reaction-diffusion pattern (Prum & Williamson 2002) | Barb-ridge spacing is an activator-inhibitor process (Harris et al. 2005) | Confuciusornis sanctus is a beaked pygostylian with ribbon rectrices and preserved feather pigment; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg parameters a=0.08, b=1.12, Du=0.5, Dv=6.0 chosen so λ_c = 143.4 µm | Spectral split-step on a periodic 8-wavelength collar; transfer_boundary: The numerical kinetics are a carrier of k_c, not a parameter table from the feather papers | 143.4 µm is the slot scale, not a new measurement of a fossil barb; does_not_claim: That the Senckenberg slab outline is a Turing pattern | That melanosome length equals 143.4 µm." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=3.55]: Add Pearson r, RMSE, and KS, plus a spatial ablation.",
        "open need [parameter_sweep/parameter-expressivity, pressure P=2.9]: Sweep Dv/Du across the Turing threshold and show λ_c moving.",
        "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=4.2]: Segment the CC BY-SA slab and fit the animated last frame to its orientation, radial FFT, and coherency.",
        "remediation needed: R1 parameter-regime sweep: vary Dv/Du and record λ_c and the selected mode",
        "remediation needed: R2 negative control: spatial equal-diffusion ablation, not only the analytic σ ceiling",
        "remediation needed: R3 segment the real Senckenberg specimen (foreground, coherency, circularity, radial wavelength) and register the GIF's last frame to that photograph",
        "remediation needed: R4 goodness-of-fit: Pearson r, RMSE, and a KS statistic against an empirical series, with at least one non-circular specimen metric" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.33e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-confuciusornis-sanctus-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Confuciusornis sanctus Turing wavelength at 143.4 µm (Yixian Fm, 125.0 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 38/100" ;
